      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I am in the Rift S using the latest Oculus PTS version.\n\nWith the controllers I was swapping between the Oculus main and Steam beta version loading each version and testing.\n\nThe beta has issues with buttons and tracking where the live Oculus was fine.\n\nSteam live was also fine before I opted into the beta.",
      "viewerReactions": null
