      "value": "@{5dcd65fae377c41b4e0e1991|full_name}: So this only occurs when using the Oculus PTS version?\n\nCan you try using the current Stable Oculus client? Please revert all \"beta\" software to the current Live Stable version (except for VRChat, of course) and try again.",
