      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Using stable Oculus now, haven't noticed it yet.\n\nIt normally happened after opening and closing VRC a few times making 'changes and testing', first time would work then after that would be bugged etc.\nI am keeping a eye on it and trying a few builds 'VRC loads' in a session to see if it continues and will report back if it does.\n\nUpdate: Yep still bugged.\nWhat happened this time is one of the few things that can happen.\n- I can move both hands separately fine.\n- No buttons work on right controller so no turning, menu etc. Oculus button is unaffected.\n- The left thumb-stick left/right turns into rotate from strafe, forward back is still move.\n- When opening the menu on left controller (Y) it appears on the right hand and not the left one which it should do.\n- The right controller does work as I can bring up Oculus home and use it normally in Oculus Dash when this happens.\n- Hand gestures / emotes only work with physical left hand and are applied to both hands simultaneously.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
