      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just a bit more to this.\n\nThe other thing that happens is the hands and controllers don't work at all and I need to exit and relaunch VRC, which will either work fine or most likely only the left controllers buttons will work.\nAnnoying when I'm testing a build and I get ho hands or movement and have to rebuild / load to get both or just the left hand working.\n\nWhen picking up and using objects as pens it picks up pens in both hands together if you them over the pens.\nAlso it draws together as only left controller works with buttons but you move the hands separate.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
