      "value": "Issue is still happening, only left controller buttons and thumb sticks work but tracking is fine both hands pretty annoying.\nOn Oculus stable version, clean install of Windows as of a week ago also.\nVRC stable has no controller issues for me like this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
