      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Issue with the right controller buttons not working and left buttons doing both hands is still happenging in Beta 906 RC, even after re-installing everything Windows, Steam, Oculus client etc.\nIt is working perfectly on Stable.\nPlease fix this bug before release as if this is pushed to live in this state your going to end up in damage control and making a public appology to try to get a quick fix out when soo many Oculus users run into this issue with the Steam client.\nI reported this bug back in November and the curent stable Steam client is fine when opting in and out of the beta.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
