  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-14T14:54:17.195Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Noticed some very annoying client bugs while building a Unity 2018 World with Oculus.\n\nWhen closing the beta it freezes and you have to right click close like 5 times before it closes.\n(Saw another topic here on this below after posting this)\n\nThere are tracking issues usually the right controller doesn't work or you can wave your arm but not click any buttons, then a third of that time both controllers don't work at all.\n\nAm slowly building my first world for the unity 2018 LTS RTM update.",
